# Monod's `G` and `H` are `G ⊤` and `H ⊤`

Every point of `P¹` is fixed by a hyperbolic element of `SL(2, ℝ)`, so `P ⊤ = univ`, and
"breakpoints in `P ⊤`" is the same as "breakpoints anywhere".
